39:| **4.1.1** (latest, on `main`) | `granite-switch-4.1.1-8b` | `guardian-core`, `decision` (updated weights) | 7 languages |
40:| 4.1 | `granite-switch-4.1-8b` | `guardian-core`, `decision` | English |
