359:Granite Switch uses **coarse-grained expert switching** — one adapter is active across all layers for a contiguous span of tokens. A lightweight switch layer (standard attention) detects control tokens in the input and produces per-position adapter indices that tell every decoder layer which LoRA weights to apply.
