   578	
   579	    For ``split_type="duplicate"`` (lora_A): both gate and up share the same
   580	    input space, so copy the identical tensor to each slice.
   581	
   582	    For ``split_type="chunk_dim0"`` (lora_B): the output dimension is
   583	    ``[gate_size | up_size]``, so chunk along dim=0 and assign each chunk
   584	    to its corresponding slice.
